# IJFW workspace ignore for Gemini CLI (P5-I1).
#
# Gemini CLI respects .gitignore by default; .planning/ lives in .gitignore
# (per-project planning artefacts, not public). Two Gemini-as-auditor
# sessions in a row failed with "ignored by configured ignore patterns"
# trying to read .planning/**/*.md, which forced the model to fabricate
# verdicts. .gemini/settings.json sets respectGitIgnore=false so audit
# lenses can read the planning docs they were asked to audit.
#
# This .geminiignore is the controlled exclusion list that replaces the
# blanket .gitignore behaviour. Keep it tight: noise out, signal in.

# Build / dep noise -- never relevant to Gemini lens work.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.turbo/

# VCS internals.
.git/

# OS / editor cruft.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local install bleed -- IJFW's installer dogfood guardrails.
.cursor/
.codex/
.claude/
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# IJFW per-install runtime state -- never useful to read for audit.
.ijfw/

# Test fixtures with large binary or generated payloads.
mcp-server/test/fixtures/longmemeval-s/

# Logs.
*.log
